@baseUrl = https://localhost:44399

### 1. Login to get a fresh Access Token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "7095834571",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store the token from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Create a Bill (EMI / Credit Card)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bills
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "HDFC Credit Card Bill",
  "category": 1,
  "amount": 4500.50,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### 3. Get All Bills for Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bills
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Create a Warranty Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/warranties
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "itemName": "Samsung Galaxy S24",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "purchaseDate": "2026-01-10",
  "expiryDate": "2027-01-10",
  "notes": "1-year manufacturer warranty"
}

### 5. Get All Warranties for Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warranties
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}